# OPTIONAL. Pulse AI works fully without this — it runs on honest placeholder
# responses when no key is set. Add a real key here only if you want live,
# personalized AI replies instead of the placeholder ones.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your real key.
# .env.local is git-ignored and will NEVER be committed — keep it that way.
#
# NOTE: Create React App inlines any REACT_APP_* variable into the browser
# JS bundle at build time. That means this key is visible to anyone who
# opens devtools on the deployed site. That's an acceptable tradeoff for a
# private investor demo, but before any public launch this should move
# behind a small backend proxy that holds the key server-side instead.

REACT_APP_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
